{
 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 63.36,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，检查每一个低级 call 的返回值，并确认目标有代码。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，检查每一个低级 call 的返回值，并确认目标有代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 9.534
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "接代币的人，按实收记账。部署到 TRON，单独处理 USDT 推送。",
   "spoken": "接代币的人，按实收记账。部署到 TRON，单独楚理 USDT 推送。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-02.wav",
   "start": 9.96,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 10.055,
   "speechEnd": 14.856
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "审计的人，找出每个推送资金的循环，问：有人拒收会怎样？",
   "spoken": "审计的人，找出每个推送资金的循环，问：有人拒收会怎样？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-03.wav",
   "start": 15.3,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 15.3,
   "speechEnd": 20.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "普通用户，只授权需要的数额，用完就撤销。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，只授权需要的数额，用完就撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-04.wav",
   "start": 21.16,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 21.16,
   "speechEnd": 25.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "收到陌生代币，不要去卖，也不要去领。",
   "spoken": "收到陌生代币，不要去卖，也不要去领。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-05.wav",
   "start": 25.54,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 25.54,
   "speechEnd": 28.827
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "在 TRON 上转 USDT，确认状态是成功，不只是已广播。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上转 USDT，确认状态是成功，不只是已广播。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-06.wav",
   "start": 29.28,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 29.28,
   "speechEnd": 34.316
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "回到开头。没有收到钱，桥为什么记下了一笔存款？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。没有收到钱，桥为什么记下了一笔存款？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-07.wav",
   "start": 34.7,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 34.7,
   "speechEnd": 39.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "因为它把成功加空返回，当成了到账，又没有问对方存不存在。",
   "spoken": "因为它把成功加空返回，荡成了到账，又没有问对方存不存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-08.wav",
   "start": 40.08,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 40.177,
   "speechEnd": 45.312
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-09",
   "text": "外部调用的返回，只是对方的说法。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用的返回，只是对方的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-09.wav",
   "start": 45.74,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 45.74,
   "speechEnd": 48.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-10",
   "text": "要证明钱到了，就看余额的变化。前提是，你清楚这个代币会不会收税。",
   "spoken": "要证明钱到了，就看余额的变化。前提是，你清楚这个代币会不会收税。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-10.wav",
   "start": 48.84,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 48.93,
   "speechEnd": 54.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-11",
   "text": "对方未必按标准出牌，你的合约要自己核对。",
   "spoken": "对方未必按标准出牌，你的合约要自己核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg5b-11.wav",
   "start": 55.38,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 55.479,
   "speechEnd": 59.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-12",
   "text": "下一集讲预言机与闪电贷。",
